{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "clm_canopy",
  "description": "CTSM/CLM canopy state and flux interface (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the canopy interception/throughfall hydrology of CanopyHydrologyMod.F90 and the pre-flux interface of BiogeophysPreFluxCalcsMod.F90 plus SurfaceHumidityMod.F90, transcribed from ctsm5.4.063 (cesm3.0-alphabranch). CanopyHydrology is CanopyInterceptionAndThroughfall (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:167) written as the interception fractions fpiliq/fpisnow (:538/:541; 0 outside the interception window so the variables are well-defined, matching the stage-1 dump's effective-coefficient convention), direct throughfall and interception (:544-549), the canopy storage ODEs for liqcan/snocan (the continuous limit of the Fortran's discrete updates: AddInterceptionToCanopy :702-703 with the max(0,.) positivity clamps, RemoveCanfallFromCanopy :835, RemoveSnowUnloading :978), the excess-storage fall fluxes (:755-758, computed only when the patch intercepts, BulkFlux_CanopyExcess :730-741), snow unloading (BulkFlux_SnowUnloading :917-925) and the wet/dry/snow-covered fractions (BulkDiag_FracWet :1120-1195), and the resulting ground fluxes qflx_snow_grnd/qflx_liq_grnd including the drip-irrigation term (SumFlux_FluxesOntoGround :1023, :1063-1067). CanopyFluxInterface is the pre-flux state consumed by CanopyFluxes/BareGroundFluxes/SoilFluxes: SetZ0mDisp (BiogeophysPreFluxCalcsMod.F90:122, ZengWang2007 branch :175-176), CalcInitialTemperatureAndEnergyVars (:225: t_grnd :334-339, emg :348, htvp :354-358, thv :364, emv :397, thm :400), and CalculateSurfaceHumidity (SurfaceHumidityMod.F90:41, vegetated-landunit branch: soilalpha :139-141, the smpmin-clamped soil relative humidity hr :135-138, qsatg_soil/qsatgdT_soil with the supersaturated-window clamp :185-190, qg_soil :191, the snow/h2osfc humidities :194-209, qg :215-216, dqgdT :197-210). All pointwise laws are imported by reference from ./clm_templates.esm. The tests pin the stage-1 CLM dumps (stage1/dumps/clm/): clm_qsat.csv, clm_run_imports.csv, clm_bareground.csv, clm_soilfluxes.csv and clm_canopyflux.csv; see stage2/README-clm.md for the coverage map and the dump defects (t_soisno lower-bound shift in clm_soilfluxes.csv/clm_soiltemp.csv, qsdT/esdT identically 0 in clm_qsat.csv). Reference: stage1/cesm/components/clm/src/biogeophys/.",
  "license": "MIT"
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "patch": {"kind": "interval", "size": "N_PATCH"},
  "column": {"kind": "interval", "size": "N_COLUMN"}
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_PATCH": {"type": "integer", "default": 1, "description": "number of patches in the stage-2 skeleton (one patch; the full model runs the clump-local begp:endp arrays), [-]"},
  "N_COLUMN": {"type": "integer", "default": 1, "description": "number of columns in the stage-2 skeleton (one column), [-]"}
 },
 "models": {
  "CanopyHydrology": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "./clm_templates.esm"}
   ],
   "variables": {
    "qflx_liq_above_canopy": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "liquid water input above the canopy = forc_rain + qflx_irrig_sprinkler (SumFlux_TopOfCanopyInputs, CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:438-476), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snow_patch": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "atmospheric snowfall at patch level (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:203,248-255), [mm/s]"},
    "check_point": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "1 when the patch intercepts precipitation: frac_veg_nosno == 1 and (forc_snow + qflx_liq_above_canopy) > 0 (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:531-532), [-]"},
    "fpiliq": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "effective liquid interception coefficient, 0 outside the interception window (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:538; the stage-1 dump normalizes the coefficient to 1 - throughfall/input, 0 when there is no input), [-]"},
    "fpisnow": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "effective snow interception coefficient, 0 outside the interception window (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:541; dump-normalized as fpiliq), [-]"},
    "qflx_through_snow": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "canopy throughfall of snow (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:544,560), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_through_liq": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "canopy throughfall of liquid (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:545,561), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_intercepted_snow": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "canopy interception of snow (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:548), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_intercepted_liq": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "canopy interception of liquid (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:549), [mm/s]"},
    "liqcan": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm", "default": 0.0, "description": "canopy liquid water storage, an ODE state (the continuous limit of the discrete update chain AddInterceptionToCanopy -> RemoveCanfallFromCanopy, CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:686,703,835), [mm]"},
    "snocan": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm", "default": 0.0, "description": "canopy snow water storage, an ODE state (AddInterceptionToCanopy -> RemoveCanfallFromCanopy -> RemoveSnowUnloading, CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:685,702,835,978), [mm]"},
    "h2ocan": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm", "description": "total canopy water h2ocan = liqcan + snocan (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1215), [mm]"},
    "vegt": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "leaf+stem area index weighted by the vegetation fraction vegt = frac_veg_nosno*(elai + esai) (BulkDiag_FracWet, CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1173), [-]"},
    "liqcanmx": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm", "description": "maximum canopy liquid storage (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:755), [mm]"},
    "snocanmx": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm", "description": "maximum canopy snow storage (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:757), [mm]"},
    "qflx_liqcanfall": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "rate of excess canopy liquid falling off, 0 outside the interception window (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:756, gated on check_point in BulkFlux_CanopyExcess :730-741), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_snocanfall": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "rate of excess canopy snow falling off, 0 outside the interception window (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:758, gated on check_point :730-741), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_snotempunload": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "canopy snow unloading from temperature (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:917), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_snowindunload": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "canopy snow unloading from wind (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:918), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_snow_unload": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "total canopy snow unloading (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:919), [mm/s]"},
    "fwet": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "fraction of canopy that is wet, 0 unless the canopy is vegetated and holds water (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1160,1170-1171), [-]"},
    "fcansno": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "fraction of canopy that is snow-covered, clamped at 1 (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1162,1173-1174), [-]"},
    "fdry": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "description": "fraction of foliage that is green and dry (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1171,1194), [-]"},
    "qflx_snow_grnd_patch": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "snow reaching the ground after interception (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1059-1061), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_liq_grnd_patch": {"type": "unknown", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "description": "liquid reaching the ground after interception, including the drip irrigation that falls through the canopy (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1063-1067), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_rain": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "atmospheric rainfall at patch level (forc_rain_downscaled_col), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snow": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "atmospheric snowfall at patch level (forc_snow_downscaled_col), [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_irrig_sprinkler": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "sprinkler irrigation added above the canopy, [mm/s]"},
    "qflx_irrig_drip": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "drip irrigation that falls through the canopy straight to the ground (SumFlux_FluxesOntoGround, CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1063-1067), [mm/s]"},
    "elai": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "one-sided leaf area index with burying by snow, [-]"},
    "esai": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "one-sided stem area index with burying by snow, [-]"},
    "frac_veg_nosno": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "fraction of vegetation not covered by snow (0 or 1), [-]"},
    "liq_canopy_storage_scalar": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm", "default": 0.1, "description": "liqcanmx per unit lai+sai (ctsm60_params.c260518.nc liq_canopy_storage_scalar = 0.1; CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:755), [mm]"},
    "snow_canopy_storage_scalar": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm", "default": 6.0, "description": "snocanmx per unit lai+sai (ctsm60_params.c260518.nc snow_canopy_storage_scalar = 6.0; CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:757), [mm]"},
    "maximum_leaf_wetted_fraction": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.05, "description": "maximum fwet (ctsm60_params.c260518.nc maximum_leaf_wetted_fraction = 0.05; CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:1161), [-]"},
    "snowcan_unload_temp_fact": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K*s", "default": 187000.0, "description": "temperature snow-unloading factor C2 of Roesch et al. (2001) (ctsm60_params.c260518.nc snowcan_unload_temp_fact = 187000; CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:917), [K s]"},
    "snowcan_unload_wind_fact": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.5, "description": "wind snow-unloading scaling factor modifying the fixed 1.56e5 divisor C3 of Roesch et al. (2001) (ctsm60_params.c260518.nc snowcan_unload_wind_fact = 0.5; CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:918), [-]"},
    "forc_t": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "atmospheric temperature (forc_t_downscaled_col), [K]"},
    "forc_wind": {"type": "parameter", "shape": ["patch"], "units": "m/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "atmospheric wind speed (forc_wind_grc), [m/s]"},
    "dtime": {"type": "parameter", "units": "s", "default": 1800.0, "description": "land model time step (get_step_size_real), [s]"}
   },
   "equations": [
    {"lhs": "qflx_liq_above_canopy", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_rain", "qflx_irrig_sprinkler"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_snow_patch", "rhs": "forc_snow"},
    {"lhs": "check_point", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": "and", "args": [
      {"op": ">", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", 0.5]},
      {"op": ">", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": ["forc_snow_patch", "qflx_liq_above_canopy"]}, 0.0]}]},
     1.0, 0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "fpiliq", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "canopy_intercept_liq", "bindings": {"elai": "elai", "esai": "esai"}},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "fpisnow", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "canopy_intercept_snow", "bindings": {"elai": "elai", "esai": "esai"}},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_through_snow", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_snow_patch", {"op": "-", "args": [1.0, "fpisnow"]}]},
     "forc_snow_patch"]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_through_liq", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "*", "args": ["qflx_liq_above_canopy", {"op": "-", "args": [1.0, "fpiliq"]}]},
     "qflx_liq_above_canopy"]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_intercepted_snow", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_snow_patch", "fpisnow"]}, 0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_intercepted_liq", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "*", "args": ["qflx_liq_above_canopy", "fpiliq"]}, 0.0]}},
    {"lhs": {"op": "D", "args": ["snocan"], "wrt": "t"},
     "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["qflx_intercepted_snow", "qflx_snocanfall"]}, "qflx_snow_unload"]}},
    {"lhs": {"op": "D", "args": ["liqcan"], "wrt": "t"},
     "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["qflx_intercepted_liq", "qflx_liqcanfall"]}},
    {"lhs": "h2ocan", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["liqcan", "snocan"]}},
    {"lhs": "vegt", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", {"op": "+", "args": ["elai", "esai"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "liqcanmx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "canopy_storage_max", "bindings": {"storage_scalar": "liq_canopy_storage_scalar", "elai": "elai", "esai": "esai"}}},
    {"lhs": "snocanmx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "canopy_storage_max", "bindings": {"storage_scalar": "snow_canopy_storage_scalar", "elai": "elai", "esai": "esai"}}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_liqcanfall", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "canopy_excess_flux", "bindings": {"can": "liqcan", "canmx": "liqcanmx", "dtime": "dtime"}},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_snocanfall", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["check_point", 0.5]},
     {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "canopy_excess_flux", "bindings": {"can": "snocan", "canmx": "snocanmx", "dtime": "dtime"}},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_snotempunload", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", 0.5]}, {"op": ">", "args": ["snocan", 0.0]}]},
     {"op": "max", "args": [0.0, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["snocan", {"op": "-", "args": ["forc_t", 270.15]}]}, "snowcan_unload_temp_fact"]}]},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_snowindunload", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", 0.5]}, {"op": ">", "args": ["snocan", 0.0]}]},
     {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["snowcan_unload_wind_fact", "snocan", "forc_wind"]}, 1.56e5]},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_snow_unload", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [
     {"op": "+", "args": ["qflx_snotempunload", "qflx_snowindunload"]},
     {"op": "/", "args": ["snocan", "dtime"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "fwet", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", 0.5]}, {"op": ">", "args": ["h2ocan", 0.0]}]},
     {"op": "min", "args": [
      {"op": "^", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["h2ocan", {"op": "*", "args": ["vegt", "liq_canopy_storage_scalar"]}]}, 0.666666666666]},
      "maximum_leaf_wetted_fraction"]},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "fcansno", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": "and", "args": [
      {"op": ">", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", 0.5]},
      {"op": ">", "args": ["h2ocan", 0.0]},
      {"op": ">", "args": ["snocan", 0.0]}]},
     {"op": "min", "args": [
      {"op": "^", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["snocan", {"op": "*", "args": ["vegt", "snow_canopy_storage_scalar"]}]}, 0.15]},
      1.0]},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "fdry", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [
     {"op": ">", "args": ["frac_veg_nosno", 0.5]},
     {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": [1.0, "fwet"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["elai", {"op": "+", "args": ["elai", "esai"]}]}]},
     0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_snow_grnd_patch", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["qflx_through_snow", "qflx_snocanfall", "qflx_snow_unload"]}},
    {"lhs": "qflx_liq_grnd_patch", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["qflx_through_liq", "qflx_liqcanfall", "qflx_irrig_drip"]}}
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "clm_canopy_throughfall_snow_step1_p1",
     "description": "Instantaneous pin against clm_canopyflux.csv (step 1, patch 1, hyd stage): a bare patch (frac_veg_nosno = 0) receives forc_snow = 5.22216069182629036e-06 mm/s with no rain. check_point = 0, so the interception branch is skipped: throughfall carries the full snowfall (CanopyHydrologyMod.F90:544,560), the interception and excess-fall fluxes are 0, the canopy fractions are 0, and qflx_snow_grnd_patch = qflx_through_snow (SumFlux_FluxesOntoGround :1059-1061; qflx_snocanfall = qflx_snow_unload = 0) while qflx_liq_grnd_patch = 0 (throughfall 0 + liqcanfall 0 + qflx_irrig_drip 0, :1063-1067). The dump row carries exactly these values (qflx_through_snow = qflx_snow_grnd = forc_snow to round-off on all 192 hyd rows).",
     "time_span": {"start": 0.0, "end": 0.0},
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "forc_snow": [5.22216069182629036e-06],
      "forc_rain": [0.0],
      "qflx_irrig_sprinkler": [0.0],
      "qflx_irrig_drip": [0.0],
      "frac_veg_nosno": [0.0],
      "elai": [0.0],
      "esai": [0.0]
     },
     "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-12, "abs": 0.0},
     "assertions": [
      {"variable": "qflx_through_snow", "time": 0.0, "expected": 5.22216069182629036e-06, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "qflx_snow_grnd_patch", "time": 0.0, "expected": 5.22216069182629036e-06, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "qflx_intercepted_snow", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "qflx_through_liq", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "qflx_liq_grnd_patch", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "fpiliq", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "fpisnow", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "fwet", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "fdry", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "fcansno", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "clm_canopy_throughfall_nosnow_step12_p16",
     "description": "Instantaneous pin against clm_canopyflux.csv (step 12, patch 16, hyd stage): a bare patch with no precipitation at all (forc_snow = forc_rain = 0). Everything evaluates to 0: throughfall of snow and liquid, the ground fluxes and the canopy fractions. The dump row is all zeros (patch 16 is one of the traced patches with forc_snow = 0 at step 12).",
     "time_span": {"start": 0.0, "end": 0.0},
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "forc_snow": [0.0],
      "forc_rain": [0.0],
      "frac_veg_nosno": [0.0]
     },
     "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-12, "abs": 0.0},
     "assertions": [
      {"variable": "qflx_through_snow", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "qflx_snow_grnd_patch", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "qflx_liq_grnd_patch", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}}
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "clm_canopy_ode_zeros_step6_p3",
     "description": "One-step continuous-ODE trace against clm_canopyflux.csv (step 6, patch 3): the ent-stage row carries liqcan = snocan = 0 with frac_veg_nosno = 0 and forc_snow = 7.05828104925227861e-06 mm/s; the hyd-stage row (the end of the same 1800 s step) carries liqcan = snocan = 0 and qflx_snow_grnd = 7.05828104925227861e-06. With check_point = 0 the interception, excess-fall and snow-unloading fluxes are all identically 0, so d(liqcan)/dt = d(snocan)/dt = 0 and the integrated state stays at 0 exactly (no scheme gap: the Fortran's discrete max(0, .) clamps of UpdateState_AddInterceptionToCanopy :702-703 are inert at zero storage). Pins the ODE wiring and the check_point gate through a full 1800 s integration.",
     "time_span": {"start": 0.0, "end": 1800.0},
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "forc_snow": [7.05828104925227861e-06],
      "forc_rain": [0.0],
      "frac_veg_nosno": [0.0],
      "dtime": 1800.0
     },
     "initial_conditions": {
      "liqcan": [0.0],
      "snocan": [0.0]
     },
     "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-12, "abs": 1e-18},
     "assertions": [
      {"variable": "liqcan", "time": 1800.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
      {"variable": "snocan", "time": 1800.0, "expected": 0.0, "coords": {"patch": 1}},
