     "description": "Ground and vegetation emissivities and the ZengWang2007 roughness laws against clm_run_imports.csv (preflux stage, step 1, patch/column 1): with frac_sno_albedo = 1 the ground emissivity emg = (1-frac_sno_albedo)*0.96 + frac_sno_albedo*0.97 = 0.97 (BiogeophysPreFluxCalcsMod.F90:348; the dump emg = 0.97 exactly on all 192 rows, consistent with frac_sno_albedo = 1 for the traced columns in clm_surfalbedo.csv), and with elai = esai = htop = 0 the vegetation emissivity emv = 1 - exp(-(elai+esai)) = 0 (:397), z0m = z0mr*htop = 0 and displa = displar*htop = 0 (:175-176) — the dumped emv/z0mv/displa are 0 exactly.",
